 "finding": "chiller_power_biquad clamps plr_raw to 1.0 when the machine cannot make the duty, so computed power FALLS with rising condenser temperature above ~32.5 C. The optimiser's main lever (fan speed down -> T_cws up) drives it into that region, where the chiller cost that should offset the fan saving is under-computed.",
